es, of course! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you, both of you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"18","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"J steps over the police cordon and enters the pharmaceutical plant, which is now without power since it has been shut down."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can't believe they actually dared to make a move on this place..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mona","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Our intel indicates that this was not the first time they have done so."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Violent clashes aren't exactly unusual, but actually storming a building is something else entirely. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is clearly a sign of something bad... It was just a pharmaceutical plant today, but it might well be City Hall tomorrow."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mona","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":5,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Tsk, who the hell's in charge here, anyway?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expr